# UI fidelity

Approved UI reference is the source of truth. Never improvise approved designs.

Respect exact hierarchy, spacing, dimensions, alignment, typography, colors, button proportions, icon sizing, safe areas, responsive behavior, and component states.

Do not substitute emojis, random icons, or platform icons for approved game assets.

If docs/PROJECT_STATE.md or docs/UI_UX_REQUIREMENTS.md still block UI, stop.

Workflow:

implement one approved screen → run → screenshot → STOP

The user sends the screenshot for pixel-perfect review. Do not continue until approved.
